## What follows from it

No two places in this article are more than a ten-minute walk apart. That is not a tourist statistic but a practical one: it means nobody has to be driven anywhere between ceremony and banquet, that guests can stretch their legs in the meantime, and that the photographer does not spend half the day in transit.

The rest — dates, capacities, who rents out what, and what needs settling before everything else — is on the [weddings page](/en/weddings).

